  "label": "emotional_distress_in_administrators",
  "description": "The meme humorously portrays the emotional distress experienced by administrators when managing difficult groups. This requires background knowledge of the real-world challenges faced by moderators, including dealing with toxic behavior, rule violations, and user conflicts. The meme's humor stems from the contrast between the baby's vulnerability and the perceived overreaction of admins, which may be seen as demeaning to those in administrative roles.",
